00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:09.580
and just kinda threw something together.

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:10.770
That's pretty good.

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:12.450
Not the best thing I've
ever had for breakfast,

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:15.440
but sweetness of the banana,
the crunch of the walnut.

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:17.780
I can see how this would
be a very filling meal.

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:20.690
So after I had breakfast, I
headed out to go shopping.

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:23.495
This is my receipt, very long.

00:02:23.495 --> 00:02:25.450
(indistinct)

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:28.020
I got tons of fruits and vegetables.

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:29.610
I don't love vegetables

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:32.830
so it was weird to get
this many, like asparagus.

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:36.130
I'm excited to push myself out
of my comfort zone and cook.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:38.300
So I'm gonna put all of this stuff away

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.570
and then I'm gonna start making dinner.

00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:42.670
So I made some whole wheat pasta

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:44.880
with this pesto that used baby rugelach,

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:47.780
spinach, lemon, almonds.

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:50.100
I had never had anything
like it. It was really tasty.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:53.000
I put that all together and to
make it a little bit hardier,

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.530
I threw in some white beans.

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:56.310
There was no meat, but that was okay.

00:02:56.310 --> 00:02:58.300
I am pretty excited that
we get to have some wine.

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:00.060
I am excited to eat those.

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:00.893
- I am too.

00:03:00.893 --> 00:03:02.230
- This doesn't feel like a diet.

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:04.313
- If this was a pasta only diet.

00:03:05.327 --> 00:03:06.596
(chuckles)

00:03:06.596 --> 00:03:07.720
- [Both] That was good.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.370
- I think we're also going to walk tonight

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:12.020
because part of the Mediterranean
lifestyle and diet is like

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:13.595
eating with other people, sharing a meal

00:03:13.595 --> 00:03:14.428
- Walking around.

00:03:14.428 --> 00:03:16.770
- and then maybe doing
some exercise you enjoy.

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:19.500
- Great.
- We are walking in the dark.

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:21.020
Do you feel healthy over in the shadow?

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:22.330
- I feel so healthy.
- This is the creepiest video

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:23.163
