00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:29.763
No.

00:03:29.763 --> 00:03:32.800
Good morning. It is day two
of the Mediterranean diet

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:34.777
and last night's dinner was really good.

00:03:34.777 --> 00:03:37.030
And so it doesn't really
feel like I'm dieting at all,

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:39.480
'cause carbs are not
off limits on this diet.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:41.220
I missed dessert last night,

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:42.880
but I think you know I'm a grownup,

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:45.470
the glass of wine was
kind of dessert on its own

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:47.630
and overall, I'm feeling good

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:48.980
