00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:38.380
At the end, just added in
some white beans and kale,

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.427
popped it off with some
bread at the very end.

00:04:40.427 --> 00:04:41.950
Aha!

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:43.850
- This is really good.
- I like it, yeah.

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:45.870
- I love the freshness of the kale in it.

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:48.610
