this doesn't taste super fishy.

00:09:34.674 --> 00:09:36.430
It's like every meal I have I'm like, oh,

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:37.823
this might be one of my favorite meals.

00:09:37.823 --> 00:09:38.656
- It's pretty good.

00:09:38.656 --> 00:09:39.860
- Well, I guess it's another dinner

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:42.570
just you and me sitting here.

00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:46.240
We always watch TV when we
eat dinner, almost always.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:48.400
But this is the 10th day
where we had just sat down

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:49.370
and talked more.

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:50.740
And honestly, I think
it's been really good

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:52.140
for our relationship.

00:09:52.140 --> 00:09:54.840
Like if you could sit
down with your family,

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:57.970
when you have time and eat
together, I highly recommend it.

00:09:57.970 --> 00:10:01.390
Day 11, I am really starting
to crave some dessert.

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:03.870
So I find a recipe online,

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.600
a tasty recipe actually, for yogurt bark.

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:09.230
So you just combine some
yogurt, some berries,

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:10.500
you blend it all up,

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:13.460
freeze it for a few hours
and you've got yogurt bark.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.930
For dinner this night I
really wanted to mix it up.

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:17.330
I'm gonna make pizza.

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:20.350
I found a recipe for a
whole wheat crust online.

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:21.480
So I'll do that tonight

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:23.277
'cause you can eat pizza
on Mediterranean diet

00:10:23.277 --> 00:10:25.530
and I feel like if you can, you should.

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:27.320
So I find a recipe online

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:29.600
and I make this whole wheat dough.

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:31.930
It takes a while because it has to prove

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:33.200
and then prove again,

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:34.560
but then Chris joined me

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:36.280
and we did all the toppings together.

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:38.170
We just use some stuff I had
left over from the (indistinct)

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:40.400
like tomatoes, cherry tomatoes,

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:42.150
we added some fennel
'cause we love fennel.

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:43.390
And we did a little bit of ham,

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:45.390
but usually I would do
like a ton of cheese,

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:46.658
but meatless cheese on this diet,

00:10:46.658 --> 00:10:48.630
so trying to stay true to that.

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:49.810
- Hey!

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:51.937
- California pizza. Can't
even wait to sit down.

00:10:51.937 --> 00:10:54.123
I'm gonna try this pizza. I'm so hungry.

00:10:55.810 --> 00:10:56.643
- How is it?

00:10:56.643 --> 00:10:57.476
- It's very good,

00:10:57.476 --> 00:10:59.460
but it's definitely a tomato pie.

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:00.810
Don't have like the cheesiness

00:11:00.810 --> 00:11:02.680
that like a big, big,
cheesy pie would have

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:03.660
but I don't mind it.

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:05.860
And the wheat crust is good.

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:08.427
Definitely not as good as
your regular old pizza crust,

00:11:08.427 --> 00:11:09.590
but it's still yummy.

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:12.550
Survey says one Chris thumb up.

00:11:12.550 --> 00:11:15.330
Chris, I made dessert tonight.

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:16.680
- Whoa, whoo!

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:18.210
- My hand's freezing up.
My hand's freezing up.

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:19.740
- Oh my God, you're
gonna burn your fingers.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:20.870
- Should we try this?
- What is that?

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:23.297
- It's yogurt and berries.
- Oh!

00:11:23.297 --> 00:11:25.370
- I just said berries
like you said berries.

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:26.763
- Berries. Some berries.

00:11:26.763 --> 00:11:27.596
- It's a little tart.

00:11:27.596 --> 00:11:28.853
- I like that though.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:30.750
- Yeah.

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.260
- It is tart.
- It got you.

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:33.240
For breakfast this morning,

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:37.990
I'm having some toast with
an egg and some berries.

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:39.790
This is my second egg of the week.

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:42.150
I don't think that's too many eggs.

00:11:42.150 --> 00:11:44.870
I usually would have
like two or one a day.

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:48.360
So I've really cut back from
my normal eggs for breakfast.

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:51.210
And I didn't have any avocado
so couldn't use any avocado.

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:52.760
So this is what we got. Cheers.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:55.570
It's oozing.

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:58.060
Yes. I like your sweater.

00:11:58.060 --> 00:11:59.440
Your sweater's very cute.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:02.380
Day 12 of Mediterranean diet.

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:03.510
I'm almost at the end of it.

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:04.343
I thought it would be like,

00:12:04.343 --> 00:12:05.780
oh, I can't wait for this to be over.

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:08.990
But actually it doesn't
feel crazy different.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:10.930
I feel healthy, I feel happy,

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:12.670
I'm going on a walk with my dog.

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:15.600
So just a couple more days
to go, definitely can do it.

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:17.510
I also had pizza leftovers for lunch.

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:18.830
It was a super easy day,

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:22.310
but I knew the real challenge
was coming the next day.

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:23.950
Day 13 was my mom's birthday

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:27.710
and we threw a big party
for her with all her family.

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:31.140
It's a party, I'm having a
cocktail, just a little one.

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:33.040
There was many Bundt cakes.

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:35.250
There was a beautiful charcuterie board.

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:37.640
My sister made tons of Mexican food

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:40.410
that we ordered from my mom's
favorite Mexican restaurant.

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:43.300
Cocktails and I partook in them all,

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.820
but it was a special occasion.

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:46.500
Yes, I went away from the diet,

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:48.240
but again, I didn't feel guilty about it

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:51.470
because on special occasions
you can indulge in this.

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:54.600
Morning. It is day 14 of
the Mediterranean diet

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:56.470
and I've got to say, I woke up.

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:59.870
I slept in and I still feel so tired.

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:01.950
Like my body feels very lethargic

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:03.410
and I honestly think it's because

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:06.570
I ate all that food yesterday,
like really rich food

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:10.360
and I just kind of kind of
amazed how quickly my body has

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:12.690
I think started to change with that diet.

00:13:12.690 --> 00:13:14.490
I'm gonna go down and have
breakfast with my family

00:13:14.490 --> 00:13:15.780
and there's gonna be lots of temptations,

00:13:15.780 --> 00:13:17.070
but it's the last day of the diet

00:13:17.070 --> 00:13:19.180
and I'm just gonna try
to like keep on track

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:21.360
and hopefully I'm gonna
feel better by this evening.

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:23.960
And that night I flew
home and when I got back,

00:13:23.960 --> 00:13:25.570
Chris was cooking for me again

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:28.020
and he made a beautiful dinner

00:13:28.020 --> 00:13:30.230
that was zoodles and shrimp.

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:32.710
And I hate zucchini, like I hate it,

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:34.640
but I loved this dinner.

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:37.490
So maybe I don't hate
zucchini. Maybe I love it.

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:39.870
We did however, on the last night,

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:42.320
watch the season finale of
one of our favorite shows

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:43.190
while we ate.

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:46.260
This diet for me was
never about losing weight,

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:48.610
but I did lose four pounds.

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:50.870
And in two weeks, that's
a pretty healthy amount

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:52.330
of weight to be losing

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:56.930
and to be indulging in some
sweets and stuff during it.

00:13:56.930 --> 00:13:58.300
I feel good about that.

00:13:58.300 --> 00:14:01.600
I overall just feel like
my mental health is better

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:04.650
and I have more energy, I
think, across the board.

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:08.240
It was a lot of work to make
your meal plans and go shopping

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.210
and do all that prep,

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:10.043
but at the end of the day,

00:14:10.043 --> 00:14:12.410
it made my life so much easier.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.380
Planning my meals for the week,

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:16.780
that is so helpful as the week goes by.

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:18.140
And it helps you make the right choices.

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:19.810
If you have the right food in your house,

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:21.330
you're gonna make better choices.

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:22.930
The diet is super customizable.

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:26.040
So there's no quantities that
you have to eat or something,

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:27.490
there's no calorie counting.

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:28.630
I didn't feel any guilt,

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.140
which I think a lot of times guilt

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:31.640
comes when you're dieting.

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:32.473
And I don't like that.

00:14:32.473 --> 00:14:33.560
It sets me up for failure.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:35.080
Give it a try if you want to.

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:36.105
Thank you guys for watching.

00:14:36.105 --> 00:14:38.688
(upbeat music)

